Error [E0420]: `cells` may be read before it is given a value
  --> unfilled_reference_list.jet:9:11
    |
  9 |     print(cells[0])
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: `cells` was declared with `Type{ uninit }`, so no value is available until you write to it — this read could see garbage
 Fix: Write to `cells` on every path before reading it (e.g. fill it via `mut cells`)
